              <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Total Invested Capital:</span> <strong>₹1,50,000</strong></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between"><span>Total Interest Accumulated:</span> <strong class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">₹1,21,214</strong></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pt-1 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
